{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13107230","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13107230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1310723001:0":{"text":"다들 조금만 더 힘내세요. 제전은 이미 시작되었는데 이곳은 아직 덜 꾸며졌으니...","source_cn":"大家再加把劲儿，祭典都开始了，咱们这里还没布置完……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A16382159B15E5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310723002:0":{"text":"무도회에 절대 착오가 있어서는 안 돼요!","source_cn":"舞会可千万不能出差错啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FDD4273222A1AC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310723003:0":{"text":"실례지만 무도회는 아직 시작 전인가요?","source_cn":"请问，舞会还没有开始吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AF70B4558495AA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310723004:0":{"text":"아, 가면무도회는 다른 종목이 모두 끝나야 시작됩니다.","source_cn":"啊，要等到其他项目都结束，化装舞会才会开始呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF453C1D1D632D5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310723005:0":{"text":"하하, 마음이 조급하신 모양이군요. 솔직히 저도 그렇답니다.","source_cn":"哈哈，看得出来你很心急了。不过偷偷告诉你，其实我也很急呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FB5819960370D9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310723006:0":{"text":"공주님께서 어떤 분과 첫 곡을 추게 되실지 너무 궁금하네요...","source_cn":"真想知道公主殿下会选择哪位客人一起跳第一支舞啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65FE16EF3D1A09C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:化装舞会主持人":{"text":"가면 무도회 진행자","source":"化装舞会主持人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}